Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.30,0:00:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.38,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.66,0:01:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but your weary ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Bellamy! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me settle this on\Nmy own terms, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.42,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just stand there\Nif you don't accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.12,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:02:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what I'm made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My conviction is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to scum man, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mortica!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's hard-headed\Nin more ways than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if you know how my power works?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean you can\Nbeat me, or even catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.64,0:03:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't congratulate yourself so quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.62,0:03:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move, Pirate Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a massive pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Commodore Dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I turn hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.78,0:04:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.24,0:04:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why are we lining up anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer Foley!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.86,0:04:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.16,0:04:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forge on ahead. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.84,0:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're from the Coliseum, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.60,0:04:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.51,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Orlumbus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If this battle were at sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.52,0:04:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have rained terror upon my foes\Nwith the full force of my Aunt Maria fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But seeing as I'm shorthanded, I'll\Nhave to leave that stone monster to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where did that\Ngiant bastard run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Pika took over the whole plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you can dodge my...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's your real laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something funny about my laugh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds way too stupid to be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the stupid one to say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens\Nwhen Lord Pika gets angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna get big? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.54,0:06:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,When I cut you down, it's\Ngonna feel real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it, Pika. You've\Ngot friends down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to squash destruction. cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore me at your own barrel kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you beating around the bush\Nso much because I'm your enemy I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't care, be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're\Ntalking about, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This next blow will strike\Nstraight through your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that you were\Naiming for my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold this hand till you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to hold hands our whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to lose you on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And you never want to lose me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If your feelings for me\Nreally are that strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,then I don't care if we're enemies or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.32,0:07:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.26,0:07:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Vice shows no mercy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.22,0:07:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a mighty warrior of Elbop\Ngets crushed under his weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's get a better look at the yinz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hirudin is down, so let's start\Nsearching for my next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that's Roro Noa Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in our way, you giant roadblock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream was to become the strongest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.76,0:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The king of all the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost in the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I was transformed into a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was saved, but I\Nfailed to repay my debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.36,0:08:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I vowed to aid the Straw Hats,\Neven if it cost me my life itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet here I lie, defeated,\Nbut shamelessly still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he, Ton Ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Was my gratitude truly so shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Lorenoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Destructive, one thousand-ton fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My honor will not allow it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.68,0:09:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He got up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me. But if you would\Nplease let me handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.86,0:09:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I root you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Still stand here. And right\Nafter I gave you such a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Proper pound. Then I'll\Nmake it even heavier for you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hellish 10,000 ton five
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope there are still some\Nbones left over for Kurasheen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.06,0:09:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no use to my allies, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But as long as I can move even a single\Narm, I can defeat an enemy leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The last of my life, I\Nplace in this first...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,GANAKA!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get squashed! High Routine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him fly to the kingdom of the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Orp eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not slowing down at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Orp night, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna get shredded!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those skies are still too far for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.88,0:11:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no bird after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.12,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy your nap. And when you\Nwake up, the cage will be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your aim sure sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.64,0:12:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a one-trick pony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Need some assistance, pirate hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The punching guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The name is Elisabello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick is an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to restore him to power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm charged and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can unleash my king punch once per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you figured out how that\Nstone giant's ability works?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me and I'll finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal, but I want to beat him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to that trump card of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what's to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take your\Nadvice and lead us to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You big stupid rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.26,0:13:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're plotting, it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.68,0:13:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I see his secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The deadly bat princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Not done yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Geofist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ice cream gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I see stiff shoulder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Immortal Warrior. Junk Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the true power of old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Xin Zhao's bounty is huge,\Nbut he's just not old enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No one understands the meaning\Nof pain better than the elderly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the greatness of\NGeo-Fist, with a capital G!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.44,0:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thoroughly oppose it. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:14:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.26,0:15:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you even talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no engagement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not marrying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that so shocking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.52,0:15:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sigh, you're already\Narranged to marry Euclesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the daughter of the\NNihushmi army's leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.98,0:15:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,High five!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.32,0:15:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I don't give a damn who I marry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.12,0:15:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You make whatever political\Nalliance you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about romance,\Nso it's all the same to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.60,0:15:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would dare to ignore Lao Chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,To be so angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.74,0:15:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't hear a word they said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.46,0:15:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, he is angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's an aura of\Nrage tipping off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess he reached the\Nnatural end of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:16:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay, but kind of\Nawkward timing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.06,0:16:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lao-G, stay with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back! Black? Black?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.00,0:16:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't understand what we\Nsaid, but he came back anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.54,0:16:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the rigors of age\Nhave not been kind to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who's talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough, Si!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Change-out's got family drama! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.88,0:16:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't hear anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's discuss this another time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your collar was crooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.06,0:16:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There. Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my wife! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.76,0:16:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your endgame?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to seduce me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be\Nfighting, not getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I fight you when you need me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.30,0:17:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let you walk away from this,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.48,0:17:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and you cause trouble for\NStraw Hat and his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.44,0:17:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,then my debt will never be repaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.86,0:17:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We're laying our lives down\Nto defeat you executives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the least we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So fight me or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.46,0:17:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll die happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all if it'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.14,0:17:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I love helping people more\Nthan anything in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out! I was kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trash-talking my enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let her battle conclude this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd regret it for the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Psy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.48,0:17:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your enemy wants to kill\Nherself, doesn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.00,0:17:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who are you fighting for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.96,0:17:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As a leader of our army, you\Ncan't afford to show mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not my master anymore, so cram it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.94,0:18:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.12,0:18:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,To be useful, even in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.26,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all that I've ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.94,0:18:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you have a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't contribute a damned thing,\Nbut she'll eat plenty, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have too many mouths to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her to the mountain\Nand leave her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, don't leave me here, please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mommy, take me with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving you because you're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.64,0:18:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not wanted or needed, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not by this world, and\Nnot by anyone in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.82,0:18:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you don't need me, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You were wrong, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now someone does need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, you stupid broad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.76,0:19:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.08,0:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.56,0:19:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Sai!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.42,0:19:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgrace to the Hapasui army!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.62,0:19:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Either correct your actions or\Nresign from your post immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.06,0:19:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay out of it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure can't check it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His headbutt can split a glacier in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll set you straight with my drill head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And that goes for the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.80,0:19:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.16,0:20:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who shall get healed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.06,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all I could ask for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to value your\Nlife more than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the only way I can help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I die, I can finally be\Nuseful to someone, can't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.62,0:21:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The world you live in is twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They taught you all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.84,0:21:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don Chin-Jow's famous drill\Nhead is bent sideways!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I did that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My attack was that powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.68,0:21:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the one whose head\Nis bent at a 90 degree angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna fight to\Nthe death, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.86,0:21:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power has awakened\Nand your form is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Though your training\Nwas filled with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.46,0:21:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,sweat and tears. It\Nhas indeed borne fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.80,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Grabs, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.78,0:22:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hoshokan technique has\Nfinally found its true heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sai, your kick shall inherit the title\NDrill Dragon Nail as my head did before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.40,0:22:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Having witnessed its strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I may rest easy, knowing that you\Ncan split the Continent of Ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hapa Sui army is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly and completely, now I shall\Ncancel your arranged marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.60,0:22:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is yours to live as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To be frank, my chronic pain has been\Nacting up since the battle with Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't been able to\Nfight to my true potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.38,0:22:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no spring chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I had started to worry,\Nbut now I know my legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.92,0:22:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,YAAAHHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.96,0:22:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the Seal of Chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:22:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Graf! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.58,0:23:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect Chi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.28,0:23:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He took down Don Chin-Jow with one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.78,0:23:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.82,0:23:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.73,0:23:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Geo-fist, ultimate technique,\Nbattle insurance fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.12,0:23:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A safety precaution to\Ncounteract infirmary or old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By performing Ji Gong exercises,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you can store away muscle from\Nyour prime to draw upon later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have combined the experience\Nof age with the vitality of youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.38,0:23:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stand before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is sublime!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What business does a filthy\Nmonkey from Kano have with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.94,0:23:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And pay back the debt of\Nhonor I owe to Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.92,0:24:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat will not\Ndefeat the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your honor is meaningless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.30,0:24:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see. Ha-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.20,0:24:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this kingdom\Nbelongs to the young master.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, all those who set foot\Nhere are no more than his slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.82,0:24:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your faith in Straw Hat\Nhas ensured your death.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.98,0:24:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the young master's birth\Ncave will be your grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.66,0:24:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Grave with a capital G!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.90,0:24:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a quick little\Nmonkey, I'll grant you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.78,0:24:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Baby Five is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.60,0:24:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.51,0:24:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.64,0:24:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, that's so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.62,0:24:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You wait right there, Baby Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:25:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll protect you and pound this interloper\Ninto the ground with a capital G!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.12,0:25:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they're fighting over me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're every bit as green as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.18,0:25:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you had any sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.36,0:25:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you would have used Baby Five as\Na shield to gain the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.92,0:25:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize\Nwhat Baby Five is worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.24,0:25:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd give her life in an\Ninstant if one of us needed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.46,0:25:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, there's scarcely a more useful\Nwoman in the world, one might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.82,0:25:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.58,0:25:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send you to hell with\Nmy final secret technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll fight for Baby Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.52,0:25:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I win, then I'm\Ngonna take her as my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.46,0:26:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.37,0:26:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill Dragon, kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.42,0:26:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.46,0:26:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You cursed gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorilla with a capital G!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.76,0:26:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me the dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.92,0:26:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Another battle on the second level\Nof the plateau comes to an end,
